---
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const exampleInput = `{"service":"inkbrain","runtime":{"language":"rust","status":"planned"},"evidence":["typed-contract","terminal-event"]}`;
const exampleOutput = `{
  "service": "inkbrain",
  "runtime": {
    "language": "rust",
    "status": "planned"
  },
  "evidence": [
    "typed-contract",
    "terminal-event"
  ]
}`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="开发者工具 — InkBrain"
  description="浏览器本地优先的工程工具设计与未来扩展边界。"
  section="tools"
>
  <PageIntro
    title="开发者工具"
    description="小而精确的工作面。第一阶段只确定工具体验、状态语言与扩展结构，所有操作暂不执行。"
    index="TOOLS / 04"
    note="以下 JSON Formatter 是 UI Demo，不会解析、复制或传输任何输入。"
  />

  <section class="content-shell" aria-labelledby="formatter-title">
    <h2 id="formatter-title" class="visually-hidden">JSON Formatter UI Demo</h2>
    <div class="tool-workbench">
      <div class="tool-demo-notice" role="note">
        <strong>UI DEMO</strong>
        <p>用于确认编辑器布局、控件层级和状态表达。按钮当前不可用，功能将在后续模块阶段实现。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-toolbar" aria-label="演示操作">
        <button type="button" disabled>Format</button>
        <button type="button" disabled>Minify</button>
        <button type="button" disabled>Copy</button>
        <button type="button" disabled>Clear</button>
        <span>LOCAL-ONLY / NOT IMPLEMENTED</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-panels">
        <div class="tool-panel">
          <label for="json-input"><span>INPUT</span><span>138 BYTES</span></label>
          <textarea id="json-input" readonly spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="demo-description">{exampleInput}</textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-panel">
          <label for="json-output"><span>OUTPUT PREVIEW</span><span>2 SPACES</span></label>
          <textarea id="json-output" readonly spellcheck="false">{exampleOutput}</textarea>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p id="demo-description" class="visually-hidden">当前输入和输出均为静态演示数据。</p>

    <div class="tool-states" aria-label="状态设计示例">
      <div class="tool-state">
        <strong>EMPTY</strong>
        <p>输入为空时保留安静的编辑区域，并解释数据只在浏览器中处理。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-state tool-state-error">
        <strong>INVALID JSON</strong>
        <p>错误需要指出位置、保留原始输入，并提供可被键盘访问的恢复路径。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tool-state">
        <strong>READY</strong>
        <p>输出完成后再开放复制动作，并通过状态区域宣布结果。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="planned-tools" aria-labelledby="planned-title">
      <h2 id="planned-title">后续工具方向</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><span>JSON Diff</span><small>planned</small></li>
        <li><span>Timestamp Converter</span><small>planned</small></li>
        <li><span>JWT Inspector</span><small>planned</small></li>
        <li><span>Prompt Contract Debugger</span><small>planned / server boundary</small></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
